flowchart TB
  DRIVE_RELEASES[(Drive immutable model releases)]
  POINTER[(model-current.json)]
  DRIVE_RUNTIME[(Drive runtime DB · schedule)]
  DELIVERY_STATE[(Drive round marker)]
  MODEL_CHECK[/GitHub Actions model-check.yml<br/>production image/]

  subgraph LOCAL[Local update-model transaction]
    direction LR
    OP[/Operator/]
    PREFLIGHT([Preflight and journal])
    TRAIN_DB[(Local training DB<br/>backup · never runtime-pushed)]
    TRAIN[[Staged train<br/>caffeinate · 100 candidates]]
    VALIDATE{Technical validation<br/>and receipt complete?}
    UPLOAD([Create-only upload])
    REDOWNLOAD{Re-download and<br/>hash verification}
    REQUEST_CHECK([Dispatch exact release<br/>and wait])
    CHECK_RESULT{Production-image<br/>workflow succeeds?}
    ACTIVATE([Move active pointer])
    REFRESH([Dispatch no-email refresh])
    KEEP([Keep previous release active<br/>resume or restart from journal])

    OP --> PREFLIGHT --> TRAIN_DB --> TRAIN --> VALIDATE
    VALIDATE -->|no| KEEP
    VALIDATE -->|yes| UPLOAD --> REDOWNLOAD
    REDOWNLOAD -->|no| KEEP
    REDOWNLOAD -->|yes| REQUEST_CHECK
    CHECK_RESULT -->|no| KEEP
    CHECK_RESULT -->|yes| ACTIVATE --> REFRESH
  end

  UPLOAD --> DRIVE_RELEASES
  DRIVE_RELEASES --> REDOWNLOAD
  REQUEST_CHECK --> MODEL_CHECK --> CHECK_RESULT
  ACTIVATE --> POINTER

  subgraph CLOUD[Serialized GitHub Actions runtime and delivery]
    direction TB
    GH_CLOCK[/GitHub off-boundary polls<br/>11:07 through 14:37/]
    GOOGLE_CLOCK[/Apps Script five-minute clock<br/>30-minute recovery slots/]
    WATCHDOG_GUARD{Actor guard passes?<br/>watchdog=true only}
    MANUAL[/Exact manual mode<br/>live includes confirmed round/]
    GATE{Drive-backed Sydney gate<br/>live · refresh · skip}
    SKIP([Skip])
    PULL([Pull runtime and active release])
    RUNTIME_DB[(Runner runtime DB<br/>predictions · ledgers)]
    CHECK{Active release valid?}
    MODE{test · refresh · live}
    TEST([Test email only<br/>no state or site mutation])
    PREDICT([Refresh data and predict<br/>auto-training forbidden])
    PREPARE([Validate credentials · token<br/>freeze recipient envelope])
    NO_CLAIM([Fail safely<br/>no marker · no SMTP])
    CLAIM{Claim round marker}
    BLOCK([Block duplicate<br/>pending = uncertain · sent])
    SMTP[/SMTP production email/]
    RECONCILE([Mark Drive sent then<br/>reconcile DB ledger])
    PUSH([Push runtime DB and schedule only])
    SITE([Publish generated site])
    ALERT([Create or update assigned<br/>automation-alert issue])

    GH_CLOCK --> GATE
    GOOGLE_CLOCK --> WATCHDOG_GUARD
    WATCHDOG_GUARD -->|yes| GATE
    WATCHDOG_GUARD -->|no| ALERT
    MANUAL --> PULL
    GATE -->|skip| SKIP
    GATE -->|live or stale refresh| PULL
    PULL --> RUNTIME_DB
    PULL --> CHECK
    CHECK -->|no| SKIP
    CHECK -->|yes| MODE
    MODE -->|test| TEST
    MODE -->|refresh| PREDICT
    MODE -->|live| PREDICT
    RUNTIME_DB --> PREDICT
    PREDICT -->|refresh| PUSH
    PREDICT -->|live| PREPARE
    PREPARE -->|invalid| NO_CLAIM
    PREPARE -->|valid| CLAIM
    CLAIM -->|not claimable| BLOCK
    CLAIM -->|pending claimed| SMTP
    SMTP -->|success| RECONCILE
    SMTP -->|partial · refused · ambiguous| BLOCK
    RECONCILE --> RUNTIME_DB
    RUNTIME_DB --> PUSH
    PUSH --> SITE
    GATE -.->|automated failure| ALERT
    PREDICT -.->|automated failure| ALERT
    RECONCILE -->|successful live closes| ALERT
  end

  POINTER --> PULL
  DRIVE_RELEASES --> PULL
  DRIVE_RUNTIME --> PULL
  OP -->|tips/advanced commands| MANUAL
  CLAIM --> DELIVERY_STATE
  DELIVERY_STATE --> CLAIM
  RECONCILE --> DELIVERY_STATE
  PUSH --> DRIVE_RUNTIME
  REFRESH -.-> MANUAL

